{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2929,"name":"Prabal","username":"prabal","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/prabal/{size}/21_2.png","created_at":"2026-03-31T10:03:21.343Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReport Author:\u003c/strong\u003e Prabal [\u003ccode\u003e5HpXW1Hf8Y9TQ2nkPXDRJts4TCAhJkSLaSLg3b5PyGSFstce\u003c/code\u003e]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExecution Details:\u003c/strong\u003e Changes will be applied at block \u003ccode\u003e#2746804\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Committee Consensus:\u003c/strong\u003e 5/7 signers \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/37?tab=proposal\"\u003ehttps://avail.subscan.io/tech/37?tab=proposal\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroduction\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis Avail Technical Committee Update informs the community of an update to the Technical Committee (TC) composition.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe TC is responsible for executing Emergency and Non-Emergency actions on-chain, with a 5/7 signing threshold. As part of ongoing governance evolution, the committee periodically reviews its composition to ensure strong technical expertise, responsiveness, and representation across the ecosystem. After internal discussion and evaluation based on the committee’s guiding principles, the TC has approved a change in its membership.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-2929-change-summary-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-2929-change-summary-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChange Summary\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne Technical Committee member has been replaced\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 5/7 signing threshold remains unchanged\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo changes to governance processes or network operations\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutgoing Member: Jakub, Engineering, \u003ccode\u003e5G22uXJAhBjsyD4G3faNsrV8hCrbbeQYwq8v9jXQG5uLzNCc\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncoming Member: Dan Mills, Product, \u003ccode\u003e5DeqwXcxn6Jhc5ZdRr9cDyxqvgeHMaUUNhb7LC8LsxfsD8hC\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Technical Committee remains committed to transparency, security, and continuous improvement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you have any questions, feel free to share them on the forum.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-03-31T10:03:21.343Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":96.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":1766,"topic_slug":"technical-committee-update-1","display_username":"Prabal","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/37?tab=proposal","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Subscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer","clicks":4}],"read":true,"user_title":"Avail Team","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":8,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/technical-committee-update-1/1766/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accept